</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Maximum number of results to return. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Sorted list (descending score) of similar adapters. Empty if query_key is not registered or k == 0.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Complexity: O(N * C_ip) for N candidates and TT inner-product cost C_ip. With <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_tensor_fingerprint_graph_1a0127422e6b8209285dc05513da6348da" kindref="member">setExactSimilarityFn()</ref></computeroutput>, complexity becomes O(N * C_backend). </para>
